aint Paul publishes no permit fee data at all (0 non-null `fees_usd` rows for June 2021), consistent with the layer's caveat that Saint Paul's register carries no fee field.

**Minneapolis**, by contrast, does publish fees — but the register writes one row per parcel per permit, so summing `fees_usd` naively would multiply fees on multi-parcel permits. I deduplicated to one fee per unique `permit_no` (2,564 distinct permits issued June 2021) and summed those.

